.TH CACTUSPLOT 1 "November 2026" "CactusPlot 0.9.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cactusplot, cactusbat \- scientific 2D plotting, compatible with Grace/xmgrace
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cactusplot
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIproject.cplot\fR|\fIproject.agr\fR|\fIdata files\fR...]
.br
.B cactusbat
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIfiles\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
CactusPlot draws publication-quality 2D plots. It reads and writes Grace projects (.agr) and its
native .cplot format, executes the Grace command language and accepts the gracebat command line.
.B cactusbat
(or
.B cactusplot -hardcopy
) runs without a graphical interface and prints the plot to a file; no display is required.
.SH OPTIONS
Options are processed in the order given, as in Grace.
.TP
.BI \-nxy " file"
Read X Y1 Y2 ... data; one set per Y column.
.TP
.BI \-block " file" "\fR, \fP\-bxy " cols
Read block data and form a set from columns such as 0:2:3.
.TP
.BI \-settype " type"
Set type of the next data file (xy, xydy, xydxdy, bar, xyhilo, xyboxplot, xycolor, ...).
.TP
.BI \-batch " file" "\fR, \fP\-param " file "\fR, \fP\-pexec " command
Execute command files or a command string.
.TP
.B \-hardcopy
Do not start the interface; print and exit.
.TP
.BI \-hdevice " device" "\fR, \fP\-printfile " file
Output device (pdf, svg, eps, ps, png, jpeg, tiff, bmp, ppm) and file.
.TP
.BI "\-o, \-\-export" " file"
Export to file (format from the extension) and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-style " name"
Style preset: Modern, Publication, Presentation, Dark, Minimal, "Journal (single column)", "Grace Classic".
.TP
.BI \-\-palette " name"
Recolour the sets from a palette (see \-\-list\-palettes).
.TP
.BI \-\-dpi " n" "\fR, \fP\-\-transparent\fR, \fP\-\-tight"
Raster resolution, transparent background, tight EPS bounding box.
.TP
.B \-graph \fIn\fR, \-graphtype \fItype\fR, \-world \fIx0 y0 x1 y1\fR, \-viewport \fIx0 y0 x1 y1\fR, \-log x|y|xy, \-autoscale x|y|xy|none
Graph selection and setup.
.TP
.B \-saveall \fIfile\fR, \-results \fIfile\fR, \-nosafe, \-noprint, \-pipe, \-npipe \fIfile\fR, \-rvideo, \-timestamp, \-seed \fIn\fR, \-wd \fIdir\fR
As in Grace.
.TP
.B \-version, \-help
Show the version or the option summary.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
cactusbat \-nxy data.dat \-hdevice PDF \-printfile figure.pdf
cactusplot old.agr \-\-style Publication \-o figure.eps \-\-tight
cactusbat \-batch figure.par \-nosafe
.fi
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/CactusPlot/CactusPlot.conf
\- preferences.
